    !! f &: [\te{B}] \ra [\te{C}] \\
    !! g &: [\te{A}] \ra [\te{B}] \up{1.35}
    !! \end{aligned}
    !! $$

    !! since in the formula

    !! $$
    !! \Large (f\circ g)(x) = f(g(x))
    !! $$

